etailed textures from the start. To further enhance the quality significantly, the SeedVR2 video upscaler is ideal, as it refines finer details without compromising the original texture integrity.\n\n## Recommended Model Downloads\n\n### Qwen Image\nSave path 📂`ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models`:  \n\nIf you have 24GB or more of VRAM the fp8 safetenors model is recommended.  \n[Download](https://civitai.com/models/1864281?modelVersionId=2110043) `qwenImage_qwenImageFp8E4m3fn.safetensors`  \n\nThe best quality can be achieved with the bf16 model. It is approximately 39 GB in size, but also works with 32 GB VRAM, as parts are then automatically swapped to RAM.  \n[Download](https://civitai.com/models/1864281?modelVersionId=2113658) `qwenImage_qwenImageFullBF16.safetensors`  \n\nIf you have less than 24GB of VRAM, the Q5_K_M GGUF model is recommended.  \n[Download](https://civitai.com/models/1842123?modelVersionId=2084674) `qwenImageGGUF_q5KM.gguf`\n\n### Qwen Text Encoder\nSave path 📂`ComfyUI/models/text_encoders`:  \n\nfp8 (recommended):  \n[Download](https://civitai.com/models/1864281?modelVersionId=2110105) `qwenImage_qwen25Vl7bFp8Scaled.safetensors`  \n\nfp16 (best quality, large filesize):  \n[Download](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b.safetensors?download=true) `qwen_2.5_vl_7b.safetensors`\n\n### Qwen VAE\nSave path 📂`ComfyUI\\models\\vae`:  \n[Download](https://civitai.com/models/1864281?modelVersionId=2110009) `qwenImage_qwenImageVAE.safetensors`  \n\n### Image Lightning 8 steps LoRA v2.0\nSave path 📂`ComfyUI\\models\\loras`:  \n[Download](https://civitai.com/models/1854805?modelVersionId=2235536) `Qwen-Image-Lightning-8steps-V2.0-bf16.safetensors`    \n\n### Film Photography LoRA\nSave path 📂`ComfyUI\\models\\loras`:  \n[Download](https://civitai.com/models/1901782/qwen-film-photography) `[Qwen] Film Photography {150e} (bluejaysierra).safetensors`   \n\n### Real Life LoRa\nSave path 📂`ComfyUI\\models\\loras`:  \n[Download](https://civitai.com/models/2056953/real-life-lora-qwen) `real_life_qwen.safetensors`  \n\n### Smartphone Snapshot Photo Reality LoRa\nSave path 📂`ComfyUI\\models\\loras`:  \n[Download](https://civitai.com/models/2022854?modelVersionId=2289403) `Qwen-Image_SmartphoneSnapshotPhotoReality_v4_by-AI_Characters_TRIGGER$amateur photo$.safetensors`   \n\n### Jibs Qwen Skin Detailer/Imperfections LoRa\nSave path 📂`ComfyUI\\models\\loras`:  \n[Download](https://civitai.com/models/2136360?modelVersionId=2416596) `Kibs_Qwen_Skin_lora_v5.safetensors`  \n\n## Installation\n\n### ComfyUI Manager Installation\n[https://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Manager?tab=readme-ov-file#comfyui-manager](https://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Manager?tab=readme-ov-file#comfyui-manager)\n\n### Installation of Missing Nodes\n\nMissing nodes in this workflow are highlighted in red. To install them, open the ComfyUI Manager and click the 'Install Missing Custom Nodes' button. \n\nAfter the installation, restart ComfyUI and refresh the browser page.\n\n \n## TL;DR\nCheck my Civitai profile for updates and other workflows: [https://civitai.com/user/ai839](https://civitai.com/user/ai839)\n\n\n\n\n\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":529,"type":"CLIPTextEncode","pos":[10,180],"size":[600,320],"flags":{"collapsed":false,"pinned":true},"order":25,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":1310},{"localized_name":"text","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"CONDITIONING","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[1281,1641]}],"title":"Positive Prompt","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.3.43","Node name for S&R":"CLIPTextEncode"},"widgets_values":["amateur photo. A friendly waitress in an Irish pub smiles warmly at the camera while holding out a rustic wooden tray. The tray is being handed to her by an unseen person standing just in front of her. On the tray is a classic burger and fries meal, featuring a juicy burger with melted cheese, bacon, crisp lettuce, fresh tomato slices, and tangy pickle slices visible inside. The golden bun is sprinkled with sesame seeds, adding a rustic touch. The rendered scene shows the rich meat juices, enhancing the burger’s mouth-watering appeal. The tray also includes ketchup in small rustic bowls and a fresh, cool Coca-Cola with carbon dioxide bubbles in it in a glass with ice cubes and a slice of lemon. The crispy, golden fries complement the meal perfectly. In the far background on the right side, a man dressed in a Batman costume runs from the end of the room towards the waitress in the foreground and confidently grabs the burger from the tray and bites into it. The cozy pub ambiance with wooden interiors and soft lighting enhances the authentic, welcoming atmosphere."],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"}],"links":[[888,365,0,8,1,"VAE"],[967,620,0,621,1,"IMAGE"],[1000,8,0,637,0,"IMAGE"],[1166,621,0,725,0,"IMAGE"],[1204,737,0,736,0,"MODEL"],[1205,549,0,736,1,"MODEL"],[1206,738,0,736,2,"BOOLEAN"],[1264,289,0,290,0,"LORA_STACK"],[1281,529,0,611,1,"CONDITIONING"],[1283,782,0,611,3,"LATENT"],[1291,736,0,290,1,"MODEL"],[1296,611,0,8,0,"LATENT"],[1309,550,0,290,2,"CLIP"],[1310,290,1,529,0,"CLIP"],[1493,880,0,878,0,"*"],[1494,880,1,878,1,"*"],[1495,880,1,879,0,"*"],[1496,880,0,879,1,"*"],[1497,878,0,879,2,"BOOLEAN"],[1498,881,0,880,0,"IMAGE"],[1501,886,0,882,1,"INT"],[1502,886,1,882,2,"INT"],[1506,887,0,886,0,"IMAGE"],[1509,892,0,889,1,"SEEDVR2_DIT"],[1510,885,0,889,2,"SEEDVR2_VAE"],[1511,879,0,889,4,"INT"],[1537,894,0,881,0,"IMAGE"],[1538,894,0,887,0,"IMAGE"],[1587,290,0,611,0,"MODEL"],[1590,901,0,620,0,"IMAGE"],[1591,901,0,621,0,"IMAGE"],[1609,8,0,894,0,"*"],[1620,882,0,889,0,"IMAGE"],[1626,889,0,901,0,"*"],[1629,894,0,882,0,"IMAGE"],[1632,911,0,887,2,"FLOAT"],[1633,912,0,881,2,"FLOAT"],[1639,901,0,694,0,"IMAGE"],[1640,621,0,694,1,"IMAGE"],[1641,529,0,913,0,"CONDITIONING"],[1642,913,0,61